<view class="page"><view class="panel"><text class="title">广告实操</text><text class="sub">设置预算和竞价，先预估再启动7日经营模拟。</text><text>日预算（$）</text><input type="digit" value="{{ads.dailyBudget}}" bindinput="onBudget"/><text>默认竞价（$）</text><input type="digit" value="{{ads.bid}}" bindinput="onBid"/><text class="stat">状态：{{ads.enabled ? '投放中' : '未启动'}}</text><button bindtap="onEstimate">预估7日广告结果</button><view wx:if="{{estimate}}" class="estimate"><text>曝光 {{estimate.impressions}}｜点击 {{estimate.clicks}}｜订单 {{estimate.orders}}</text><text>花费 ${{estimate.spend}}｜ACOS {{estimate.acos * 100}}%｜ROAS {{estimate.roas}}</text></view><button bindtap="onStartWeek">启动7日经营模拟</button><button bindtap="onBack">返回店铺</button></view></view>